# Blog Posts Directory

Place your markdown blog posts here. Each post should be a `.md` file with frontmatter.

Example structure:

```markdown
---
title: "Your Post Title"
excerpt: "A brief description of your post"
author: "Author Name"
date: "December 20, 2024"
category: "Category"
readTime: "5 min read"
image: "/images/blog/your-image.jpg"
tags:
  - Tag1
  - Tag2
featured: false
---

Your markdown content here...
```

